Yesterday, when attempting to start my computer, I hit a kernel panic
quite early in the boot process. The bug no longer appeared after a
restart. This is on AMD Athlon 64 3000+, in 64-bit mode, with a nVidia
nForce 4 chipset (ASUS A8N5X).

Here's what fit on my screen after the panic (yay 80x25 terminals):

